Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:33:07 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 036/230] Add Privacy and Terms pages in both languages

Short, honest documents (what we store, ESPN data, Adsgram ads, how deletion
works, a contact placeholder) rendered from a data-driven section list and
linked from Profile and the onboarding footer. Route paths live in one
constant the router imports, and the test asserts every section resolves and
is genuinely translated in EN and FA.
